{"ID":"20260916155514-6a1lw7f","Spec":"3","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-6a1lw7f","title":"LeetCode 3. 无重复字符的最长子串","type":"doc","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916155514-3t4v4nw","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-3t4v4nw","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260916155514-lbtafsf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-lbtafsf","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"难度：Medium　标签：哈希表、字符串、滑动窗口　链接：https://leetcode.cn/problems/longest-substring-without-repeating-characters/"}]}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-945mu1e","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-945mu1e","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"题目"}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-wd4hfmr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-wd4hfmr","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"给一个字符串 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"s"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，找出里面"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"不含重复字符"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"最长子串"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，返回它的长度。注意是\"子串\"（连续的一段），不是\"子序列\"（可以跳着挑），这个区别坑过我好多次。"}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-ip2nv5q","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-ip2nv5q","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916155514-3ozljkg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-3ozljkg","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916155514-v85u6uu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-v85u6uu","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"约束：​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"0 \u0026lt;= s.length \u0026lt;= 10^5"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"s"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 由英文字母、数字、符号和空格组成。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-frek2ty","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-frek2ty","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916155514-fro6oyb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-fro6oyb","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"示例 1：​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"s = \"abcabcbb\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ → ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\"abc\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​）"}]}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-i0ke119","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-i0ke119","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916155514-vrodubp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-vrodubp","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"示例 2：​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"s = \"bbbbb\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ → ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\"b\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​）"}]}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-zex8qwc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-zex8qwc","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916155514-1fljr5w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-1fljr5w","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"示例 3：​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"s = \"pwwkew\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ → ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\"wke\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，注意 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\"pwke\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 是子序列，不算）"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-tczjf7v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-tczjf7v","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"思路"}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-07ks8yj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-07ks8yj","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一反应当然是暴力：以每个位置为起点，一直往后加字符，用一个标记数组记住哪些字符出现过了，一撞到重复就停，记下这轮长度，取最大。想是好想，但两重循环是 O(n²)，n 到 10 万的时候心里有点发毛。"}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-7vanf5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-7vanf5r","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后我盯着\"起点往后加\"这句话发呆：每次换新起点都要重新数一遍，前面那一大段其实白扫了。比如 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\"abcabcbb\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，从下标 0 数到 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\"abcab\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，发现第二个 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"b"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 重复了；那下一轮从下标 1 开始时，我为什么还要一个个重新标记？直接把左边界挪到重复字符 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"b"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"上次出现位置 + 1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 不就完了。这不就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"滑动窗口"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"嘛：右指针负责往右扩张，左指针只在必要时往右跳，被跳过的字符统统踢出窗口。每个字符最多进窗口一次、出窗口一次，整体就是 O(n)。"}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-qmbapu2","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-qmbapu2","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916155514-tv9gjcm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-tv9gjcm","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916155514-gz6bsej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-gz6bsej","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关键点：用 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"last[c]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 记字符 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"c"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"上一次出现的下标"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；当 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"last[c] \u0026gt;= left"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（说明它还在当前窗口里）时，令 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"left = last[c] + 1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，否则左指针不动。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-wrzytow","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-wrzytow","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916155514-wnid72r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-wnid72r","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复杂度：时间 O(n)，空间 O(1)（字符集固定，最多 128 个 ASCII 字符）。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-nswzq4y","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-nswzq4y","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"代码（C）"}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-2djl9hb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-2djl9hb","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解法一：暴力枚举（好想，但慢）"}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-s19c5uy","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-s19c5uy","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Yw=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// LeetCode 3 无重复字符的最长子串\n// 这题看着像道数学题，其实就是\"从每个位置往后数\"的老套路\n// 思路：双层循环 + 一个标记数组，看看从下标 i 出发最多能延伸多长\n\n#include \u003cstring.h\u003e\n#include \u003cstdbool.h\u003e\n\nint lengthOfLongestSubstring(char* s) {\n    int n = strlen(s);\n    int best = 0;\n\n    // 枚举每一个起点 i\n    for (int i = 0; i \u003c n; i++) {\n        // seen[c]：字符 c 在\"这一轮以 i 为起点\"的子串里出现过没有\n        // 注意它每换一个起点就要清空一次，这就是暴力慢的原因\n        bool seen[128] = {false};\n        int j = i;\n\n        // 从 i 往后一直加，直到撞见重复字符为止\n        for (; j \u003c n; j++) {\n            unsigned char c = (unsigned char)s[j]; // 关键！转成 unsigned char 再当下标，防止出现负下标\n            if (seen[c]) break;   // 这个字符在本轮已经出现过了，本轮到此结束\n            seen[c] = true;       // 标记为已出现\n        }\n\n        int len = j - i;          // 本轮最长无重复子串长度\n        if (len \u003e best) best = len;\n    }\n    return best;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-s8kuspt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-s8kuspt","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"时间复杂度 O(n²)（最坏），空间 O(128)。"}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-ftldo37","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-ftldo37","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解法二：滑动窗口 + 手搓数组哈希表（O(n)）"}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-4h6n3tr","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-4h6n3tr","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Yw=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 解法二：滑动窗口，一次遍历 O(n)\n// 关键洞察：右指针右移时，如果新字符 c 之前出现过，而且它上次的位置\n// 还在窗口里（last[c] \u003e= left），那左指针直接跳到 \"last[c] + 1\"，\n// 中间那段字符全部扔掉；要是上次位置已经在窗口外了，左指针不用动。\n// 千万别无脑写 left = last[c] + 1，那样左指针可能会往回退！\n\n#include \u003cstring.h\u003e\n\nint lengthOfLongestSubstring(char* s) {\n    int last[128];                          // last[c] = 字符 c 上次出现的下标\n    for (int i = 0; i \u003c 128; i++) last[i] = -1; // -1 表示这个字符还没出现过\n\n    int n = strlen(s);\n    int left = 0;                           // 窗口左边界\n    int best = 0;\n\n    for (int right = 0; right \u003c n; right++) {\n        unsigned char c = (unsigned char)s[right];\n\n        if (last[c] \u003e= left) {              // 它还在窗口里，冲突了\n            left = last[c] + 1;             // 左边界跳到它的下一位\n        }\n        last[c] = right;                    // 更新它的最新位置\n\n        int len = right - left + 1;         // 当前窗口长度\n        if (len \u003e best) best = len;\n    }\n    return best;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-um3sxao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-um3sxao","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"时间复杂度 O(n)，空间 O(128)。每个字符只被访问常数次，比暴力快了一个数量级。"}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-dci6tfb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-dci6tfb","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本地想自己跑一下"}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-g8nt4nj","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-g8nt4nj","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Yw=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 本地调试用的 main，力扣提交时不需要这段\n// 把解答函数和 main 合起来就是一个能直接编译运行的完整程序\n\n#include \u003cstdio.h\u003e\n#include \u003cstring.h\u003e\n\nint lengthOfLongestSubstring(char* s) {\n    int last[128];\n    for (int i = 0; i \u003c 128; i++) last[i] = -1;\n\n    int n = strlen(s);\n    int left = 0;\n    int best = 0;\n\n    for (int right = 0; right \u003c n; right++) {\n        unsigned char c = (unsigned char)s[right];\n        if (last[c] \u003e= left) {\n            left = last[c] + 1;\n        }\n        last[c] = right;\n        int len = right - left + 1;\n        if (len \u003e best) best = len;\n    }\n    return best;\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    // 注意：字符串字面量要放到可写的数组里，别写 char* p = \"abc\";\n    char a[] = \"abcabcbb\";\n    char b[] = \"bbbbb\";\n    char c[] = \"pwwkew\";\n    char d[] = \"\";   // 空串的边界情况\n\n    printf(\"abcabcbb -\u003e %d\\n\", lengthOfLongestSubstring(a)); // 期望 3\n    printf(\"bbbbb    -\u003e %d\\n\", lengthOfLongestSubstring(b)); // 期望 1\n    printf(\"pwwkew   -\u003e %d\\n\", lengthOfLongestSubstring(c)); // 期望 3\n    printf(\"(空串)   -\u003e %d\\n\", lengthOfLongestSubstring(d)); // 期望 0\n\n    return 0;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-iy1z8du","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-iy1z8du","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"踩坑与收获"}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-xfrkqc5","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-xfrkqc5","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916155514-bdyjc80","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-bdyjc80","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916155514-zb8eafm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-zb8eafm","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"空串的边界"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"s.length"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 允许为 0，一开始根本没管。好在滑动窗口的循环天然不执行、返回 0，刚好对；但要是代码里手贱写了 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"last[s[0]]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 这种就当场崩了，所以还是老实把 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"last"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 全部初始化成 -1 稳妥。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-1rh0oxn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-1rh0oxn","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916155514-rw9ueuv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-rw9ueuv","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong code","TextMarkTextContent":"char"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"到底有没有符号"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"char"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的符号性是\"实现定义的\"，在 x86 的 gcc/clang 上默认是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"signed char"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（-128~127）。拿它当下标，遇到字节值 \u003e127 的字符就会变成负数、直接越界。本题说 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"s"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 由英文字母、数字、符号、空格组成，全是 ASCII，其实不转也没事；但 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"(unsigned char)s[j]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 这个习惯我打算一直留着，万一哪天遇到中文/UTF-8 字节就安全了。以前从没注意过！原来是这样！"}]}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-7lqngzv","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-7lqngzv","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916155514-13cxpjr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-13cxpjr","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"左指针别乱退"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：我第一版差点写成 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"left = last[c] + 1;"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 无条件执行，问了下 AI 才反应过来——如果 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"last[c]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 在窗口外（​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"last[c] \u0026lt; left"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​），这行会把左指针"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"往回拽"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，答案就错了。必须加 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"if (last[c] \u0026gt;= left)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​。这个条件才是整个滑窗的灵魂。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-1k3ajdn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-1k3ajdn","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916155514-lv3uixj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-lv3uixj","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"子串 vs 子序列"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：题目专门拿示例 3 提醒你 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\"pwke\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 不算——它是子序列不是子串。这种\"题意陷阱\"以后看到要第一时间划重点。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260916155514-q726wdi","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-q726wdi","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916155514-fj60pom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916155514-fj60pom","updated":"20260916155514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"哦买噶，从 O(n²) 挖到 O(n)，还顺手搞懂了一个负下标的隐患，这波不亏，我牛大了。"}]}]}]}]}